//forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-30T12:08:19-07:00","id":1258243,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24\" data-vbnamecard=\"24\">Mr Gone</a>, if I can have some ideas for second version of the main Beast sheet, after my own experience in running the Beast game:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>'Family Ties' section on 1st page should be renamed into 'Lair's Traits'. Best would be somehow put there 'Per Scene:__' line, as this things rise with general Lair dots level - Lair's Traits are used by all Beasts, Family Ties are used only on those that made special crossover connection with other monsters.</li> <li>'Kinship Nightmares' section on 2nd page should then by renamed in to 'Family Ties &amp; Kinship' - it's enough place for both. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></li> <li>In 'Visuals' section on 4th page, 'Group Chart' should be renamed 'Lair Chambers' - Your Chambers are more important.</li> <li>As 5th page you could add Horror sheet that would be based on 'Dream Form' section of our Astral Traveler sheet from 2E Mage. Maybe expand it to the whole sheet page with using your Lair Sheet stuff. Or just merge Lair Sheet with 'Dream Form' section of Astral Traveler and update it's as 'Lair and Horror' sheet, simply. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-30-2018, 03:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-30T17:13:26-07:00","id":1258297,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258243#post1258243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24\" data-vbnamecard=\"24\">Mr Gone</a>, if I can have some ideas for second version of the main Beast sheet, after my own experience in running the Beast game: <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>'Family Ties' section on 1st page should be renamed into 'Lair's Traits'. Best would be somehow put there 'Per Scene:__' line, as this things rise with general Lair dots level - Lair's Traits are used by all Beasts, Family Ties are used only on those that made special crossover connection with other monsters.</li> <li>'Kinship Nightmares' section on 2nd page should then by renamed in to 'Family Ties &amp; Kinship' - it's enough place for both. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></li> <li>In 'Visuals' section on 4th page, 'Group Chart' should be renamed 'Lair Chambers' - Your Chambers are more important.</li> <li>As 5th page you could add Horror sheet that would be based on 'Dream Form' section of our Astral Traveler sheet from 2E Mage. Maybe expand it to the whole sheet page with using your Lair Sheet stuff. Or just merge Lair Sheet with 'Dream Form' section of Astral Traveler and update it's as 'Lair and Horror' sheet, simply. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></li> </ol></div> </div> </div> </div>Hey! Thanks for the suggestions. If you don't mind, send me an email sometime(so I can keep better track of it) and I'll add this to my to-do list. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-30T18:45:27-07:00","id":1258312,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258243#post1258243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24\" data-vbnamecard=\"24\">Mr Gone</a>, if I can have some ideas for second version of the main Beast sheet, after my own experience in running the Beast game:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>'Family Ties' section on 1st page should be renamed into 'Lair's Traits'. Best would be somehow put there 'Per Scene:__' line, as this things rise with general Lair dots level - Lair's Traits are used by all Beasts, Family Ties are used only on those that made special crossover connection with other monsters.</li> <li>'Kinship Nightmares' section on 2nd page should then by renamed in to 'Family Ties &amp; Kinship' - it's enough place for both. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></li> <li>In 'Visuals' section on 4th page, 'Group Chart' should be renamed 'Lair Chambers' - Your Chambers are more important.</li> <li>As 5th page you could add Horror sheet that would be based on 'Dream Form' section of our Astral Traveler sheet from 2E Mage. Maybe expand it to the whole sheet page with using your Lair Sheet stuff. Or just merge Lair Sheet with 'Dream Form' section of Astral Traveler and update it's as 'Lair and Horror' sheet, simply. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></li> </ol></div> </div> </div> </div>There's already an addon sheet for Lair layout and Lair traits that you can easily merge into the core sheet pdf, which provides for points 1-3.<br /> <br /> Having somewhere to notate both the Horrors stats as well as the Beast's non-merged dream form would be amazing, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-30T21:42:50-07:00","id":1258325,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258312#post1258312\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's already an addon sheet for Lair layout and Lair traits that you can easily merge into the core sheet pdf, which provides for points 1-3.</div> </div> </div> </div>I designed <u>a lot </u>of sheets with Mr. Gone ( if I recall now, circa 30 to this day ). One thing I learned on them all -<br /> <i>'If the thing is very important to gameplay and shows even in slightest story about the game - even in shortest oneshot - it should be on 1st page'</i>.<br /> Idea is to maximlize 1st page usability, not overbear players with needless section on first sight, etc. Lair Traits are those crucial thing. Family Ties are not so. And still Family Ties would simply be on 2nd page. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Lair's Traits is <b>much more</b> important than Family Ties list in gameplay. When you ran oneshot game - you prepare only 1 page sheets, now full 4 page 'monsters', so new players will not be freaked out. Just see <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/192937/ReadyMade-Characters-Beast-the-Primordial\" target=\"_blank\">how are made official Ready Made characters</a>. For example, I ran Beasts only sessions - that are core of game - and we dearly missed Traits. Family Ties are all good to be on second page as crossovers are encouraged, but not the heart of the system. Players all the time try to impose Traits, Family Ties can be made only when ST shows other-non Beasts monsters in story.<br /> <br /> Lair's Traits are crucial to game experience, as they open Primordial Pathways to Lair, impose combat modifiers with other and much, much more other mechanics related. That's why short list of them should be on 1st page of main sheet. Even minimalist, 1 page sheets should have Traits list on it. And even having full, proper list on another sheet is all good for it. Lair Traits &gt;&gt; Family Ties, simply<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258312#post1258312\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Having somewhere to notate both the Horrors stats as well as the Beast's non-merged dream form would be amazing, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait, what? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><b> Horrors Dream Form stats are not the same as human Hosts Dream Form?</b> Are this only when Horror is Slumbering, that they are disconnected?<br /> <br /> If you want to see, <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/MtANWOD/MtA_2ndED_AstralTraveler_Oneiros_Sheet_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here is Astral Traveler sheet for Mage</a> on my design. I would simply used left column for Dream Forms, maybe use it once again if those are two different. Then you can make 1st page on Dream Forms, 2nd page on Lair. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-01-2018, 12:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-30T22:25:40-07:00","id":1258330,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> No, Horror Form is much more potent. For one, they take the highest of their power/manipulation/resistance attributes as their base. Then, you get to spend 2 x Lair on Attributes in addition. So horror Form is quite powerful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-30T22:35:52-07:00","id":1258331,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258330#post1258330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> No, Horror Form is much more potent. For one, they take the highest of their power/manipulation/resistance attributes as their base. Then, you get to spend 2 x Lair on Attributes in addition.</div> </div> </div> </div>Once spent those 2 x Lair Attributes dots are set in stone, yes? They do not change on each visit to Lair, or something? They only can be added if you rise Lair?<br /> <br /> With <b>Beast's Players Guide</b> Merit like <i>Legendary Horror </i>maybe it's good thing to also add Rank, Influences, Numina and Essence small sections to Horror's Sheet? It's not that all Beast have those, but once you have, it's useful to have them.<br /> <br /> If going with adding Ephemeral Entity stuff to Horror Sheet, I would based it on my <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/WtF/WtF_2ndED_Spirits_1-Page_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Spirits-Totem one for 2E Werewolf</a>. Later today I prepare mock sketch of it, so you can discuss usability of it here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-30T23:45:02-07:00","id":1258340,"title":"","content":"This is first draft of Beast's Horror Sheet ( with Human Dream Form section ). Fonts and borders will be changed in final version. Idea is to make 2 page Horror &amp; Lair Sheet. with 1st page made by my and adding Lair Sheet as 2nd page.<br /> As you can see, I added also Lair's Chamber list with pointing on what locations they are based to easy track them on bottom. Rest of fan sheets just let you paint <i>configurations</i> of Chambers, not listing the Chambers themselves. If you like this - write a comment. If you have better idea what should be on the bottom of Horror Sheet - I'm all ears. I need to know when sheet idea is approved to send to <b>Mr Gone</b>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8JeDM1s.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-01-2018, 03:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-01T05:37:42-07:00","id":1258367,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258340#post1258340\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is first draft of Beast's Horror Sheet ( with Human Dream Form section ). Fonts and borders will be changed in final version. Idea is to make 2 page Horror &amp; Lair Sheet. with 1st page made by my and adding Lair Sheet as 2nd page.<br /> As you can see, I added also Lair's Chamber list with pointing on what locations they are based to easy track them on bottom. Rest of fan sheets just let you paint <i>configurations</i> of Chambers, not listing the Chambers themselves. If you like this - write a comment. If you have better idea what should be on the bottom of Horror Sheet - I'm all ears. I need to know when sheet idea is approved to send to <b>Mr Gone</b>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8JeDM1s.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> </div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>I like this, but it would be nice to have more room to describe what Traits are active 'by default' in a specific Chamber, though IU suppose it could just go in the description field.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-01T05:39:29-07:00","id":1258368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258330#post1258330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> For one, they take the highest of their power/manipulation/resistance attributes as their base.</div> </div> </div> </div>Beasts do this in their Dream Form, too, I believe. The only differences are the free attribute dots from Lair, and any bonuses from Legendary Horror (both of which are still very significant).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3570,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","user":"lnodiv","date":". 10-01-2018, 08:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-01T06:04:08-07:00","id":1258372,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258367#post1258367\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like this, but it would be nice to have more room to describe what Traits are active 'by default' in a specific Chamber, though IU suppose it could just go in the description field.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Can Traits be active on default in each Chamber, separately?</b> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> From my reading of <b>BtP</b> corebook it was more like Horror can activate all Traits in particular Chamber, if he really likes. It's that each Chamber has one default Trait that gave the next Trait to general Horror's Trait's list. Thinking about it - maybe you are right here. Maybe there should be default Trait to each Chamber...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-01T06:14:03-07:00","id":1258374,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258368#post1258368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Beast's do this in their Dream Form, too, I believe.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Horror being what it is, combined with the fact that the bonus Lair dots weren't part of the Horror's form in the initial draft and the Begotten's general tendency to treat exploring the Astral as more of a specialized pursuit, inclines me to think otherwise \u2014 it's hard to claim the minimal extra power of Being A Dragon when your self-image is still just as human as it is in the material world.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258372#post1258372\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Can Traits be active on default in each Chamber, separately?</b></div> </div> </div> </div>A Beast's Chambers can be subject to any combination of their Lair Traits at any time, and the Beast can choose to exclude individual guests from those Traits' effects without turning them off entirely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 10-01-2018, 09:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-01T12:28:14-07:00","id":1258422,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258374#post1258374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Horror being what it is, combined with the fact that the bonus Lair dots weren't part of the Horror's form in the initial draft and the Begotten's general tendency to treat exploring the Astral as more of a specialized pursuit, inclines me to think otherwise</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I was mis-remembering the section, thinking that particular part was in the Dream Form section and not the Horror sidebar.<br /> <br /> And to clarify what I mean about 'default' traits: I've had plenty of Makara, for example, that don't necessarily manifest Suffocating (to represent absolute flooding) in all of their Chambers, reserving it for only a few.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-01T21:35:32-07:00","id":1258498,"title":"","content":"As Beast newbie - <b>Do Human Dream Form use highest in Power, Finesse and Resistant category - or not? </b>Or maybe highest of two Attributes in those categories, like mages do?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258422#post1258422\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And to clarify what I mean about 'default' traits: I've had plenty of Makara, for example, that don't necessarily manifest Suffocating (to represent absolute flooding) in all of their Chambers, reserving it for only a few.</div> </div> </div> </div>From how I read <b>BtP</b> corebook - Each not taken Chamber X in Primordial Dream has Trait Z ( like, for example, <i>Burning </i>Trait for the Volcano place ). Then comes Beast with Traits A &amp; B already and as she has rise Lair Rating - she can take Chamber X to add to Lair. From there Beast can always invoke Traits A, B &amp; Z, <i>however</i>, on default, each Chamber X scene still starts from Trait Z each scene with it. Because, you know, Lava in Volcano <b>is</b> <i>Burning</i> on general. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-02-2018, 12:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-01T22:00:57-07:00","id":1258499,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258498#post1258498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As Beast newbie - <b>Do Human Dream Form use highest in Power, Finesse and Resistant category - or not? </b>Or maybe highest of two Attributes in those categories, like mages do?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's explicitly just the Mental Attributes for regular humans and most other supernatural beings. It says this in the section that talks about Dream Form on page 99.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-01T23:42:26-07:00","id":1258507,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258499#post1258499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's explicitly just the Mental Attributes for regular humans and most other supernatural beings. It says this in the section that talks about Dream Form on page 99.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, wording on Horror's traits seems to imply that Beast ( as only human host ) uses rules for humans.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BtP, p. 99</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Beast\u2019s Horror has a much larger, more potent presence within the Primordial Dream than others. The Horror uses the highest of the Beast\u2019s Strength, Presence,or Intelligence as Power; Dexterity, Manipulation, or Wits as Finesse; and Stamina, Composure, or Resolve as Resistance.</div> </div> </div> </div>For clarity sake only, I point that mages uses highest of two Attributes in particular category:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>'MtAw, p. 249</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">The dream form has the following Traits instead of the mage\u2019s standard set:<br /> \u2022 Power: Equal to the higher of Intelligence or Presence for mages, or just Intelligence for others. (...)<br /> \u2022 Finesse: Equal to the higher of Wits or Manipulation for mages, or just Wits for others. (...)<br /> \u2022 Resistance: Equal to the higher of Resolve or Composure for mages, or just Resolve for others. (...)</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-02T03:38:30-07:00","id":1258520,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258498#post1258498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From there Beast can always invoke Traits A, B &amp; Z, <i>however</i>, on default, each Chamber X scene still starts from Trait Z each scene with it. Because, you know, Lava in Volcano <b>is</b> <i>Burning</i> on general. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Beasts have absolute control over what Lair traits manifest in any given Chamber of their Lair, though - so it follows that if they want whatever it's 'native' trait is on or off by default, it will be. If they want a trait to be active in a Chamber forever, it will be. If they don't want it active in a Chamber ever, it won't be.<br /> <br /> The freedom to invoke traits in their Lair also extends to <i>not </i>invoking them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-04T18:06:15-07:00","id":1258977,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258312#post1258312\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's already an addon sheet for Lair layout and Lair traits that you can easily merge into the core sheet pdf, which provides for points 1-3.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yea! I do have one of those. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/773542-beast-character-sheets?p=1258312#post1258312\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Having somewhere to notate both the Horrors stats as well as the Beast's non-merged dream form would be amazing, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Have to see what I can do sometime. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"